Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:18:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2576 (RW-001): a helper's answer moves the goal's next check

After an answer arrived the owner's run showed the card and buttons but
never called set_task_wake, so next_wake_at stayed at the send-time value
(goal 20796). Now, when the answer's run leaves the wake exactly as it
found it, the server moves it to 24 h from now; a wake the run chose is
never touched. The wake is compared as stored text, because the column
keeps microseconds and a JS Date does not. No new text. The brief half of
the row stays the model's.

